---
title: Paloma
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, tequila]
source: Classic cocktail, number 8 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Rub a #highball glass{} rim with lime and dip it in @kosher salt{}, then fill the glass with ice. Pour in @tequila{2%fl_oz} and @lime juice{0.5%fl_oz}, add a pinch of @salt{}, and top with @grapefruit soda{4%fl_oz}. Stir gently and garnish with a @grapefruit{1%wedge}.

> No grapefruit soda? Use 2 fl oz fresh grapefruit juice, 2 fl oz club soda and a quarter ounce of simple syrup.
